      "text": [
        " إِذَا اشْتَدَّتْ عَلَيْهِ النَّزْعُ فَضَعْهُ فِي مُصَلَّاهُ الَّذِي كَانَ يُصَلِّي فِيهِ أَوْ عَلَيْهِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Hammad, from Hareyz, from Zurara who said, ",
          "‘When the snatching (of the soul) is difficult upon him, place him in his prayer-mat which he was prayin <span class=\"iTxt\">Salaat</span> in, or on it’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "3. Ali has narrated from his father from Hammad from Hariz from Zurarah who has said the following: “He (the Imam), ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘If dying becomes difficult for a person, you should place him in the place where he would perform his prayer.’” "
        ]
      }
